\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\d{3})+|\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\d{2,})$/\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n/**\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n * 遺??遺?? ??씊?ゃ궧?덉쓽 寃?section-list??MARK_PATTERN)??S(佯딀씮)瑜??뷀뻽????\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n * 鴉뤷쎋?먮뒗 ?ㅳ꺀??遺?멸? ?섏삤怨?由ъ뒪???쒖뿉???섏삤吏 ?딅뒗??\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n */\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nconst MARK_PATTERN = /^(?:C|G|FC|FG|B|CB|S|W)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\d+[A-Z]?$/\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n/** 釉붾줉 ?쒕ぉ. ???롥틞鴉뤷쎋1/100?띿쿂??異뺤쿃??遺숈뼱 ?ㅻ?濡?遺遺??쇱튂濡?蹂몃떎 */\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nconst BLOCK_TITLE_PATTERN = /鴉뤷쎋/\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n// ?ㅼ륫 湲곕컲 ?덉슜?ㅼ감. 洹쇨굅???ㅽ뙆?댄겕 ?ㅼ륫媛믪씠怨?ADR-030???곸뿀??\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n/** ?쇰꺼??媛숈? 諛대뱶濡?蹂대뒗 怨좎젙 醫뚰몴 ?덉슜?ㅼ감. ?ㅼ륫 ?몄감??1pt 誘몃쭔?대떎 */\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nconst BAND_TOLERANCE_PT = 8\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n/** 移섏닔 ?댁씠 ?쇰꺼 諛대뱶?먯꽌 ?⑥뼱吏????덈뒗 嫄곕━. ?ㅼ륫 理쒕? 50pt(kani X) */\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nconst DIMENSION_WINDOW_PT = 60\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n/** 移섏닔 以묒떖怨??몄젒 異?以묒젏???닿툔???덉슜. ?ㅼ륫 理쒕? 8pt, ?몃? 移섏닔 ?곗뇙??\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n *  理쒓렐???ㅽ깘??40pt??洹??ъ씠???붾떎 */\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nconst MIDPOINT_TOLERANCE_PT = 15\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n/** ?ㅽ뙩蹂??ㅼ륫 異뺤쿃(pt/mm)??以묒븰媛??鍮??덉슜 ?몄감. ?ㅼ륫 理쒕? 0.5% */\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nconst SCALE_TOLERANCE_RATIO = 0.03\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n/**\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n * 遺?몃? 寃⑹옄?먃룹쨷?먯뿉 遺숈씠???덉슜 嫄곕━ 竊?洹?諛⑺뼢 **以묒븰媛??ㅽ뙩**????鍮꾩쑉.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n *\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n * ?몄젒 ?ㅽ뙩???곗? ?딅뒗 ?댁쑀媛 ?덈떎: ?ㅻЪ yokohama p7??bX3?밹X1? 1200mm(34pt)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n * 吏쒕━ 醫곸? ?좊씪, ?몄젒 ?ㅽ뙩 湲곗??대㈃ ?덉슜??8pt濡?醫곸븘??凉뺝눣渶싳쑝濡?20pt易?\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n * 鍮꾩폒 ?곹엺 ??遺?멸? ?듭㎏濡??⑥뼱吏꾨떎. 以묒븰媛믪? 洹?醫곸? ???섎굹???붾뱾由ъ? ?딅뒗??\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n *\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n * 1/4???섍만 ?섎뒗 ?녿떎 ??寃⑹옄?먭낵 以묒젏??諛??ㅽ뙩 媛꾧꺽?대?濡?1/4???뚯뼱??履쎌뿉??\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n * 遺숈씪 ???덈떎?띿쓽 寃쎄퀎?? 洹몃낫???ш쾶 ?≪쑝硫??대뒓 履쎌씤吏 ?쒗뭹??怨좊Ⅴ寃??쒕떎.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n */\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nconst SNAP_RATIO = 0.25\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n/**\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n * X쨌Y ??吏앹????곹븳 竊?X ?싥굤??쓽 以묒븰媛??ㅼ륫 ?ㅽ뙩 횞 ??鍮꾩쑉.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n * ?섏씠吏 異뺤쿃???곕씪 ?④퍡 蹂?섍퀬, Y ?쇰꺼 ?좉? ????ㅽ뙩 1.5移몃낫??硫硫?\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n * 媛숈? 鴉뤷쎋?대씪??湲고븯 洹쇨굅媛 ?놁쑝誘濡?釉붾줉???댁? ?딅뒗??\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n */\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nconst GRID_PAIRING_DISTANCE_RATIO = 1.5\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\ninterface LabelToken {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  label: string\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  letter: 'X' | 'Y'\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  x: number\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  y: number\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\ninterface PositionedToken {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  text: string\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  x: number\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  y: number\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\ninterface DimensionToken {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  valueMm: number\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  x: number\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  y: number\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\ninterface AxisSequence {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  letters: Set<'X' | 'Y'>\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  /** positionPt媛 ?대뒓 醫뚰몴?멸? ??移섏닔 留ㅼ묶??媛숈? 醫뚰몴瑜?遊먯빞 ?쒕떎 */\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  alongKey: 'x' | 'y'\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  /** 諛대뱶??怨좎젙 醫뚰몴(?됯퇏) ??移섏닔 李쎌쓽 湲곗? */\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  across: number\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  axes: AxisCandidate[]\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n/** 移섏닔쨌異뺤쿃源뚯? ?뺤씤???앸궃 異??? 洹몃━???뺤쓽? 釉붾줉???????ш린???섏삩??*/\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\ninterface ValidatedSequence extends AxisSequence {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  direction: 'X' | 'Y'\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  spansMm: number[]\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  scalePtPerMm: number\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  totalConfirmed: boolean\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n/**\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n * ?멸렇癒쇳듃 ?섎굹瑜??쇰꺼???곗냽?쇰줈 ?섍?瑜몃떎. `makeSegments`???쒖쓽 移몄쓣 臾띠쑝?ㅺ퀬\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n * 留뚮뱺 洹쒖튃?대씪 ?몄젒?????싥굤??쓣 ???⑹씠濡?遺숈씤?????ㅻЪ yokohama p7?먯꽌\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n * `bX3`(34pt 媛꾧꺽)? `cX1`???똟X3cX1?띿씠 ?먮떎.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n *\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n * ?섍?瑜??쇰꺼??醫뚰몴??**洹??쇰꺼???대， 臾몄옄?ㅼ뿉??* ?ㅼ떆 ?곕떎. ?깅텇쨌蹂닿컙?쇰줈\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n * 留뚮뱾硫??꾨㈃???녿뒗 ?꾩튂瑜??쒗뭹???뺥븯??寃껋씠 ?섍퀬, 洹??꾩튂媛 洹몃?濡??ㅽ뙩\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n * 移섏닔??以묒젏 ?먯젙???곗씤??\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n *\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n * ?멸렇癒쇳듃 ?꾩껜媛 ?쇰꺼濡??④??놁씠 ?ㅻ챸???뚮쭔 諛쏅뒗??\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n */\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nfunction splitAxisLabels(segment: TextSegment, y: number): LabelToken[] {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  // NFKC媛 ??湲?먮? ?щ윭 湲?먮줈 ?대뒗 寃쎌슦媛 ?덉쑝誘濡?1:1??媛?뺥븯吏 ?딄퀬\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  // 臾몄옄留덈떎 ?띿뒪?몄긽??援ш컙??湲곕줉???섏갼?붾떎\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  let text = ''\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const spans: Array<{ start: number; end: number; item: TextItem }> = []\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  for (const item of segment.items) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const piece = compact(item.str)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    if (piece === '') continue\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    spans.push({ start: text.length, end: text.length + piece.length, item })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    text += piece\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  if (text === '') return []\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const tokens: LabelToken[] = []\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  AXIS_LABEL_PATTERN.lastIndex = 0\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  while (AXIS_LABEL_PATTERN.lastIndex < text.length) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const start = AXIS_LABEL_PATTERN.lastIndex\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const match = AXIS_LABEL_PATTERN.exec(text)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    if (!match) return []\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const end = AXIS_LABEL_PATTERN.lastIndex\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const owned = spans\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      .filter((span) => span.start < end && span.end > start)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      .map((span) => span.item)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    if (owned.length === 0) return []\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    let minX = Number.POSITIVE_INFINITY\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    let maxX = Number.NEGATIVE_INFINITY\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    for (const item of owned) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      if (item.x < minX) minX = item.x\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      if (item.x + item.w > maxX) maxX = item.x + item.w\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    tokens.push({\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      label: match[0],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      letter: match[0].includes('X') ? 'X' : 'Y',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      x: (minX + maxX) / 2,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      y,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  return tokens\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\ninterface CollectedTokens {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  labels: LabelToken[]\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  dimensions: DimensionToken[]\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  marks: PositionedToken[]\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  titles: PositionedToken[]\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nfunction collectTokens(page: TextPage): CollectedTokens {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const labels: LabelToken[] = []\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const dimensions: DimensionToken[] = []\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const marks: PositionedToken[] = []\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const titles: PositionedToken[] = []\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const classify = (text: string, x: number, y: number) => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    if (DIMENSION_PATTERN.test(text)) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      dimensions.push({\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        valueMm: Number.parseInt(text.replaceAll(',', ''), 10),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        x,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        y,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      return\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    if (MARK_PATTERN.test(text)) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      marks.push({ text, x, y })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      return\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    if (BLOCK_TITLE_PATTERN.test(text)) titles.push({ text, x, y })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  for (const row of recoverRows(page.items)) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    for (const segment of row.segments) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      labels.push(...splitAxisLabels(segment, row.y))\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      classify(segment.compact, segment.centerX, row.y)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  // ?몃줈?곌린??臾몄옄 醫뚰몴媛 ?몃줈濡??먮Ⅴ誘濡??섍?瑜닿린瑜?嫄몄? ?딅뒗?????ㅼ륫 肄뷀띁?ㅼ쓽\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  // ?몃줈 ?곗? 移섏닔肉먯씠怨? ?몃줈 ?쇰꺼??遺숈뼱 ?섏삤???꾨㈃? 鍮??꾨낫濡??ㅽ뙣?쒕떎 (R10)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  for (const run of verticalRuns(page.items)) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    if (/^[a-z]?[XY]\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\d+$/.test(run.text)) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      labels.push({\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        label: run.text,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        letter: run.text.includes('X') ? 'X' : 'Y',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        x: run.x,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        y: run.y,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      continue\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    classify(run.text, run.x, run.y)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  return { labels, dimensions, marks, titles }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n/**\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n * ?쇰꺼?ㅼ쓣 怨좎젙 醫뚰몴媛 ?댁뼱吏??諛대뱶濡?臾띔퀬, 諛대뱶 ?덉뿉???꾩튂 ?ㅻ쫫李⑥닚?쇰줈\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n * ?섏뼱?볦? ???쇰꺼??諛섎났?섎뒗 ?먮━?먯꽌 媛덈씪 異??댁쓣 留뚮뱺???????섏씠吏??\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n * 媛숈? 洹몃━?쒖쓽 鴉뤷쎋媛 ?щ윭 釉붾줉 ?덉쑝硫??ㅻЪ p7) 媛숈? 諛대뱶???댁씠 諛섎났?쒕떎.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n */\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nfunction axisSequences(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  labels: LabelToken[],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  across: 'x' | 'y',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n): AxisSequence[] {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const along = across === 'x' ? 'y' : 'x'\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const sorted = [...labels].sort((a, b) => a[across] - b[across])\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const bands: LabelToken[][] = []\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  for (const token of sorted) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const band = bands.at(-1)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const previous = band?.at(-1)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    if (\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      band &&\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      previous &&\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      token[across] - previous[across] <= BAND_TOLERANCE_PT\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    ) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      band.push(token)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    } else {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      bands.push([token])\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const sequences: AxisSequence[] = []\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  for (const band of bands) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    if (band.length < 2) continue\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const ordered = [...band].sort((a, b) => a[along] - b[along])\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    let current: LabelToken[] = []\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const flush = () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      if (current.length >= 2) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        sequences.push({\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n          letters: new Set(current.map((token) => token.letter)),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n          alongKey: along,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n          across:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n            current.reduce((total, token) => total + token[across], 0) /\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n            current.length,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n          axes: current.map((token) => ({\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n            label: token.label,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n            positionPt: token[along],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n          })),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      current = []\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    for (const token of ordered) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      if (current.some((seen) => seen.label === token.label)) flush()\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      current.push(token)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    flush()\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  return sequences\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n/** ?몄젒 異??띿쓽 以묒젏?먯꽌, ?쇰꺼 諛대뱶??移섏닔 李??덉뿉 ?덈뒗 移섏닔瑜?李얜뒗??*/\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nfunction dimensionAt(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  dimensions: DimensionToken[],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  used: Set<DimensionToken>,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  along: 'x' | 'y',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  across: 'x' | 'y',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  midpoint: number,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  bandAcross: number,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n): DimensionToken | undefined {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  let best: DimensionToken | undefined\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  let bestDistance = Number.POSITIVE_INFINITY\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  for (const token of dimensions) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    if (used.has(token)) continue\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const alongDistance = Math.abs(token[along] - midpoint)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    if (alongDistance > MIDPOINT_TOLERANCE_PT) continue\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    if (Math.abs(token[across] - bandAcross) > DIMENSION_WINDOW_PT) continue\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    if (alongDistance < bestDistance) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      best = token\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      bestDistance = alongDistance\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  return best\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nfunction median(values: number[]): number {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  return [...values].sort((a, b) => a - b)[Math.floor(values.length / 2)]\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nfunction validateSequence(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  sequence: AxisSequence,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  dimensions: DimensionToken[],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  issue: (code: PlanGridIssue) => void,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n): ValidatedSequence | undefined {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  if (sequence.letters.size > 1) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    issue('?⒲깧?ユ뻼耶쀦렁??)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    return undefined\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const alongKey = sequence.alongKey\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const acrossKey: 'x' | 'y' = alongKey === 'y' ? 'x' : 'y'\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const used = new Set<DimensionToken>()\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const spans: DimensionToken[] = []\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  for (let i = 0; i + 1 < sequence.axes.length; i++) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const midpoint =\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      (sequence.axes[i].positionPt + sequence.axes[i + 1].positionPt) / 2\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const dimension = dimensionAt(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      dimensions,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      used,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      alongKey,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      acrossKey,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      midpoint,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      sequence.across,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    )\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    if (!dimension) break\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    used.add(dimension)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    spans.push(dimension)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  if (spans.length < sequence.axes.length - 1) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    issue('野멩퀡轝좄맼')\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    return undefined\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  // ?ㅽ뙩蹂??ㅼ륫 異뺤쿃??媛덈━硫?移섏닔 ?ㅻ같?뺤씠????議곗슜??洹몃━?쒕? ?대뒓???ㅽ뙣?쒕떎\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const scales = spans.map(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    (span, i) =>\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      (sequence.axes[i + 1].positionPt - sequence.axes[i].positionPt) /\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      span.valueMm,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  )\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const medianScale = median(scales)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  if (\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    scales.some(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      (scale) => Math.abs(scale / medianScale - 1) > SCALE_TOLERANCE_RATIO,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    )\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  ) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    issue('潁?갰訝띷빐??)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    return undefined\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  // ?꾩껜 移섏닔(泥???以묒젏)媛 ?덉쑝硫??⑷퀎 寃利앹떇?쇰줈 ?대떎 ??遺덉씪移섎뒗 ?ㅻ룆 ?좏샇??\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const spanSum = spans.reduce((sum, span) => sum + span.valueMm, 0)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const first = sequence.axes[0].positionPt\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const last = sequence.axes.at(-1)?.positionPt ?? first\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const total = dimensionAt(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    dimensions,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    used,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    alongKey,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    acrossKey,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    (first + last) / 2,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    sequence.across,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  )\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  if (total && total.valueMm !== spanSum) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    issue('?덅쮫訝띴???)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    return undefined\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  return {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    ...sequence,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    direction: [...sequence.letters][0],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    spansMm: spans.map((span) => span.valueMm),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    scalePtPerMm: medianScale,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    totalConfirmed: total !== undefined,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nfunction extent(axes: AxisCandidate[]): { min: number; max: number } {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  return {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    min: axes[0].positionPt,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    max: axes[axes.length - 1].positionPt,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n/** ?먯뿉??援ш컙源뚯???嫄곕━. 援ш컙 ?덉씠硫?0 */\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nfunction distanceToRange(value: number, min: number, max: number): number {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  if (value < min) return min - value\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  if (value > max) return value - max\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  return 0\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n/**\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n * 遺?멸? 遺숇뒗 ?먮━瑜?留뚮뱺????寃⑹옄?먭낵 洹??ъ씠 以묒젏??踰덇컝???볦씤 ?덇툑?대떎.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n * 吏앹닔 index媛 寃⑹옄??index/2), ??섍? 以묒젏(?ъ씠 (index-1)/2).\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n */\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nfunction snapTargets(axes: AxisCandidate[]): number[] {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const targets: number[] = []\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  for (let i = 0; i < axes.length; i++) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    targets.push(axes[i].positionPt)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    if (i + 1 < axes.length) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      targets.push((axes[i].positionPt + axes[i + 1].positionPt) / 2)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  return targets\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nfunction spanLengths(axes: AxisCandidate[]): number[] {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  return axes\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    .slice(1)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    .map((axis, i) => axis.positionPt - axes[i].positionPt)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\ninterface Snap {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  index: number\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  onNode: boolean\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nfunction snap(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  value: number,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  axes: AxisCandidate[],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  limit: number,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n): Snap | undefined {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const targets = snapTargets(axes)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  let best = -1\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  let bestDistance = Number.POSITIVE_INFINITY\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  for (let i = 0; i < targets.length; i++) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const distance = Math.abs(targets[i] - value)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    if (distance < bestDistance) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      best = i\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      bestDistance = distance\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  if (best < 0 || bestDistance > limit) return undefined\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  return { index: best >> 1, onNode: best % 2 === 0 }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nfunction placementFor(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  mark: string,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  x: Snap,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  y: Snap,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n): MemberPlacement {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  if (x.onNode && y.onNode) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    return { mark, role: '?쇔춴??, ix: x.index, iy: y.index }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  if (!x.onNode && y.onNode) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    return { mark, role: '渦?, ix: x.index, iy: y.index, axis: 'X' }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  if (x.onNode && !y.onNode) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    return { mark, role: '渦?, ix: x.index, iy: y.index, axis: 'Y' }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  return { mark, role: '?쇻궎', ix: x.index, iy: y.index }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nfunction gridCandidate(sequence: ValidatedSequence): PlanGridCandidate {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  return {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    direction: sequence.direction,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    axes: sequence.axes,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    spansMm: sequence.spansMm,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    scalePtPerMm: sequence.scalePtPerMm,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    totalConfirmed: sequence.totalConfirmed,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n/**\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n * 釉붾줉??吏볥뒗????X ???섎굹? **媛??媛源뚯슫** Y ???섎굹瑜?吏앹쭞?붾떎.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n *\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n * 怨좎젙 ?щ갚?쇰줈 ?뚰룷?ⓦ띿쓣 ?먯젙?섏? ?딅뒗 ?댁쑀: ?쇰꺼? ?꾨㈃ 諛붽묑???볦씠誘濡?\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n * ?щ갚???꾩슂?쒕뜲(?ㅻЪ 156pt), 洹??щ갚???볧엳硫???釉붾줉???닿퉴吏 ?쇳궓??\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n * 理쒓렐?묒? 洹??ъ씠瑜??ъ? ?딄퀬???녹? 吏앹쓣 怨좊Ⅸ??\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n *\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n * 媛숈? 釉붾줉???꽷룹븘???쇰꺼 ?좊뒗 異??꾩튂媛 媛숈쑝誘濡?洹??먮━?먯꽌 ?섎굹濡??묓엺??\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n */\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nfunction buildBlocks(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  xSequences: ValidatedSequence[],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  ySequences: ValidatedSequence[],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  marks: PositionedToken[],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  titles: PositionedToken[],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  issue: (code: PlanGridIssue) => void,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n): PlanBlock[] {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const blocks: PlanBlock[] = []\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  if (xSequences.length === 0 || ySequences.length === 0) return blocks\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const seen = new Set<string>()\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const claimedY = new Map<ValidatedSequence, string>()\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  for (const xSequence of xSequences) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const xExtent = extent(xSequence.axes)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const xKey = xSequence.axes\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      .map((axis) => `${axis.label}@${Math.round(axis.positionPt)}`)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      .join(',')\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const pairingLimit =\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      median(spanLengths(xSequence.axes)) * GRID_PAIRING_DISTANCE_RATIO\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    let paired: ValidatedSequence | undefined\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    let pairedDistance = Number.POSITIVE_INFINITY\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    let tied = false\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    for (const ySequence of ySequences) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      const claimedBy = claimedY.get(ySequence)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      if (claimedBy !== undefined && claimedBy !== xKey) continue\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      const distance = distanceToRange(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        ySequence.across,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        xExtent.min,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        xExtent.max,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      )\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      if (distance < pairedDistance) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        paired = ySequence\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        pairedDistance = distance\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        tied = false\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      } else if (distance === pairedDistance) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        tied = true\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    if (!paired || tied || pairedDistance > pairingLimit) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      issue('?싥굤???恙쒍툖??)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      continue\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    claimedY.set(paired, xKey)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const xGrid = gridCandidate(xSequence)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const yGrid = gridCandidate(paired)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const xAxes = xGrid.axes\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const yAxes = yGrid.axes\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const key = [xAxes, yAxes]\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      .map((axes) =>\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        axes\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n          .map((axis) => `${axis.label}@${Math.round(axis.positionPt)}`)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n          .join(','),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      )\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      .join('|')\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    if (seen.has(key)) continue\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    seen.add(key)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const xLimit = median(spanLengths(xAxes)) * SNAP_RATIO\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const yLimit = median(spanLengths(yAxes)) * SNAP_RATIO\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const yExtent = extent(yAxes)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const placements: MemberPlacement[] = []\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const unplacedMarks: string[] = []\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    for (const mark of marks) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      // 釉붾줉 諛뽰쓽 遺?몃뒗 ?꾩삁 蹂댁? ?딅뒗????媛숈? ?섏씠吏????씊?ゃ궧?덇? ?욎씤??\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      // ?먯젙 ?щ갚???ㅻ깄 ?덉슜怨?媛숆쾶 ?먯뼱, ?뚮툝濡??덉씤??紐?遺숈??ㅳ띿?\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      // ?뚮툝濡?諛뽰씠?ㅳ띻? 媛숈? ?먮줈 媛덈━寃??쒕떎\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      if (distanceToRange(mark.x, xExtent.min, xExtent.max) > xLimit) continue\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      if (distanceToRange(mark.y, yExtent.min, yExtent.max) > yLimit) continue\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      const x = snap(mark.x, xAxes, xLimit)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      const y = snap(mark.y, yAxes, yLimit)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      if (!x || !y) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        if (!unplacedMarks.includes(mark.text)) unplacedMarks.push(mark.text)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        continue\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      placements.push(placementFor(mark.text, x, y))\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    // ?쒕ぉ? 釉붾줉??媛濡?踰붿쐞 ?덉뿉 ?덈뒗 寃껊쭔 蹂몃떎 ???섎???????鴉뤷쎋?먯꽌\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    // ?몃줈 嫄곕━留뚯쑝濡?怨좊Ⅴ硫???釉붾줉???쒕ぉ??遺숇뒗??\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    let title: string | undefined\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    let titleDistance = Number.POSITIVE_INFINITY\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    for (const candidate of titles) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      if (distanceToRange(candidate.x, xExtent.min, xExtent.max) > 0) continue\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      const distance = distanceToRange(candidate.y, yExtent.min, yExtent.max)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      if (distance < titleDistance) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        title = candidate.text\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        titleDistance = distance\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    blocks.push({\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      ...(title === undefined ? {} : { title }),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      xGrid,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      yGrid,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      placements,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      unplacedMarks,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  return blocks.sort(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    (a, b) =>\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      a.xGrid.axes[0].positionPt - b.xGrid.axes[0].positionPt ||\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      a.yGrid.axes[0].positionPt - b.yGrid.axes[0].positionPt,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  )\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nexport function parseFramingPlan(page: TextPage): ParsedFramingPlan {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const { labels, dimensions, marks, titles } = collectTokens(page)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const issues: PlanGridIssue[] = []\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const issue = (code: PlanGridIssue) => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    if (!issues.includes(code)) issues.push(code)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  if (labels.length === 0) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    return { grids: [], blocks: [], issues: ['?싥굤??꺀?쇻꺂?ゆ쩂??] }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  // ?쇰꺼 臾몄옄?댁씠 媛濡쒕줈 ?볦뿬??諛대뱶(異뺤쓽 ?섏뼱??諛⑺뼢)???몃줈?????덈떎 ??\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  // ??諛⑺뼢 ??臾띠뼱 蹂닿퀬, 寃利?以묒젏 移섏닔쨌異뺤쿃)??媛吏?諛대뱶瑜?嫄몃윭?몃떎.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const validated = [\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    ...axisSequences(labels, 'x'),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    ...axisSequences(labels, 'y'),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  ].flatMap((sequence) => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const result = validateSequence(sequence, dimensions, issue)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    return result ? [result] : []\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const grids: PlanGridCandidate[] = []\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const seen = new Set<string>()\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  for (const sequence of validated) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const candidate = gridCandidate(sequence)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const key = [\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      candidate.direction,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      candidate.axes.map((axis) => axis.label).join(','),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      candidate.spansMm.join(','),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    ].join('|')\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    if (seen.has(key)) continue\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    seen.add(key)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    grids.push(candidate)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  grids.sort(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    (a, b) =>\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      a.direction.localeCompare(b.direction) ||\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      a.axes[0].positionPt - b.axes[0].positionPt,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  )\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const blocks = buildBlocks(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    validated.filter((sequence) => sequence.direction === 'X'),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    validated.filter((sequence) => sequence.direction === 'Y'),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    marks,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    titles,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    issue,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  )\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  return { grids, blocks, issues }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n--- parse tests ---\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nimport { describe, expect, it } from 'vitest'\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nimport type { TextItem } from '../types'\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nimport type { TextPage } from '../section-list/types'\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nimport { parseFramingPlan } from './parse'\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n// ?ㅻЪ ?꾨㈃ ?쎌뒪泥??議곕뒗 tests/plan-import/parse.test.ts???덈떎.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n// ?ш린???⑹꽦 TextPage濡??뚯꽌??寃쎄퀎 洹쒖튃留?怨좎젙?쒕떎 (section-list? 媛숈? 遺꾨떞).\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n/** 媛濡쒖벐湲??좏겙 ?섎굹. w=0?대씪 centerX == x ??以묒젏 怨꾩궛???뺤닔濡??좎??쒕떎. */\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nfunction h(str: string, x: number, y: number): TextItem {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  return { str, x, y, w: 0, h: 8 }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n/** ?몃줈?곌린(rot=-90) ?좏겙 ?섎굹. verticalRuns媛 ?⑤룆 ?곗쑝濡?蹂듭썝?쒕떎. */\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nfunction v(str: string, x: number, y: number): TextItem {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  return { str, x, y, w: 8, h: 0, rot: -90 }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nfunction page(items: TextItem[]): TextPage {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  return { widthPt: 1000, heightPt: 1000, items }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\ndescribe('parseFramingPlan ???싥굤??궛?ゃ긿??, () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('?쇰꺼???섎굹???놁쑝硫??싥굤??꺀?쇻꺂?ゆ쩂??, () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const parsed = parseFramingPlan(page([h('8700', 200, 80)]))\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(parsed.grids).toEqual([])\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(parsed.issues).toEqual(['?싥굤??꺀?쇻꺂?ゆ쩂??])\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('媛濡?諛대뱶: ?쇰꺼 2蹂?+ 以묒젏 移섏닔 ??X ?꾨낫', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const parsed = parseFramingPlan(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      page([h('X1', 100, 50), h('X2', 300, 50), h('6000', 200, 80)]),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    )\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(parsed.issues).toEqual([])\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(parsed.grids).toEqual([\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        direction: 'X',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        axes: [\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n          { label: 'X1', positionPt: 100 },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n          { label: 'X2', positionPt: 300 },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        ],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        spansMm: [6000],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        scalePtPerMm: 200 / 6000,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        totalConfirmed: false,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    ])\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('?몃줈 諛대뱶: ?꾩튂??y, 移섏닔??rot=-90 ?곗뿉???⑤떎', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const parsed = parseFramingPlan(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      page([h('bY1', 50, 100), h('bY2', 50, 300), v('4500', 80, 200)]),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    )\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(parsed.issues).toEqual([])\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(parsed.grids).toEqual([\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        direction: 'Y',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        axes: [\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n          { label: 'bY1', positionPt: 100 },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n          { label: 'bY2', positionPt: 300 },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        ],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        spansMm: [4500],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        scalePtPerMm: 200 / 4500,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        totalConfirmed: false,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    ])\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('?쇳몴 移섏닔(6,000)瑜?mm ?뺤닔濡??쎈뒗??, () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const parsed = parseFramingPlan(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      page([h('X1', 100, 50), h('X2', 300, 50), h('6,000', 200, 80)]),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    )\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(parsed.grids[0]?.spansMm).toEqual([6000])\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('?몄젒 ?띿쓽 以묒젏??移섏닔媛 ?놁쑝硫?野멩퀡轝좄맼 ???꾨낫瑜??댁? ?딅뒗??, () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const cases: TextItem[][] = [\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      // 移섏닔 ?먯껜媛 ?녿떎\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      [h('X1', 100, 50), h('X2', 300, 50)],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      // 以묒젏?먯꽌 20pt 踰쀬뼱?щ떎 (?덉슜 15pt)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      [h('X1', 100, 50), h('X2', 300, 50), h('6000', 220, 80)],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      // ?쇰꺼 諛대뱶?먯꽌 70pt ?⑥뼱吏??ㅻⅨ ?댁쓽 ?レ옄??(李?60pt)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      [h('X1', 100, 50), h('X2', 300, 50), h('6000', 200, 120)],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    ]\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    for (const items of cases) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      const parsed = parseFramingPlan(page(items))\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      expect(parsed.grids).toEqual([])\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      expect(parsed.issues).toEqual(['野멩퀡轝좄맼'])\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('?ㅽ뙩蹂??ㅼ륫 異뺤쿃??3%瑜??섍쾶 媛덈━硫?潁?갰訝띷빐??, () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const parsed = parseFramingPlan(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      page([\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        h('X1', 100, 50),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        h('X2', 300, 50),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        h('X3', 500, 50),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        h('6000', 200, 80),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        h('3000', 400, 80), // 媛숈? 200pt?몃뜲 3000mm ??異뺤쿃??2諛?媛덈┛??      ]),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    )\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(parsed.grids).toEqual([])\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(parsed.issues).toEqual(['潁?갰訝띷빐??])\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('?꾩껜 移섏닔媛 ?ㅽ뙩 ?⑷낵 ?쇱튂?섎㈃ totalConfirmed', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const parsed = parseFramingPlan(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      page([\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        h('X1', 100, 50),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        h('X2', 300, 50),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        h('X3', 500, 50),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        h('6000', 200, 80),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        h('6000', 400, 80),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        h('12000', 300, 110), // 泥???以묒젏. ?몄젒 以묒젏(200쨌400)怨쇰뒗 100pt ?⑥뼱???덈떎\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      ]),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    )\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(parsed.issues).toEqual([])\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(parsed.grids[0]?.totalConfirmed).toBe(true)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('?꾩껜 移섏닔媛 ?ㅽ뙩 ?⑷낵 ?ㅻⅤ硫??덅쮫訝띴??????ㅻ룆 ?좏샇?대?濡??꾨낫瑜??댁? ?딅뒗??, () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const parsed = parseFramingPlan(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      page([\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        h('X1', 100, 50),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        h('X2', 300, 50),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        h('X3', 500, 50),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        h('6000', 200, 80),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        h('6000', 400, 80),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        h('11000', 300, 110),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      ]),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    )\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(parsed.grids).toEqual([])\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(parsed.issues).toEqual(['?덅쮫訝띴???])\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('媛숈? 諛대뱶?먯꽌 ?쇰꺼??諛섎났?섎㈃ 釉붾줉 寃쎄퀎濡?媛덈씪 ?쎄퀬, ?숈씪 寃곌낵???섎굹濡??묐뒗??, () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    // ???섏씠吏??媛숈? 洹몃━?쒖쓽 鴉뤷쎋媛 ??釉붾줉 ???ㅻЪ p7??諛곗튂??    const parsed = parseFramingPlan(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      page([\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        h('X1', 100, 50),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        h('X2', 300, 50),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        h('X1', 700, 50),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        h('X2', 900, 50),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        h('6000', 200, 80),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        h('6000', 800, 80),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      ]),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    )\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(parsed.issues).toEqual([])\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(parsed.grids).toHaveLength(1)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(parsed.grids[0]?.axes.map((axis) => axis.label)).toEqual([\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      'X1',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      'X2',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    ])\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('??諛대뱶??X? Y ?쇰꺼???욎씠硫??⒲깧?ユ뻼耶쀦렁????諛⑺뼢??吏?대궡吏 ?딅뒗??, () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const parsed = parseFramingPlan(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      page([h('X1', 50, 100), h('Y2', 50, 300), v('4500', 80, 200)]),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    )\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(parsed.grids).toEqual([])\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(parsed.issues).toEqual(['?⒲깧?ユ뻼耶쀦렁??])\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n})\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\ndescribe('parseFramingPlan ??遺??諛곗튂', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  /** 3횞3 寃⑹옄 ?섎굹. X: X1쨌X2쨌X3 (0쨌200쨌400pt), Y: Y1쨌Y2쨌Y3 (0쨌200쨌400pt) */\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  function gridItems(): TextItem[] {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    return [\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      h('X1', 0, -40),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      h('X2', 200, -40),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      h('X3', 400, -40),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      h('6000', 100, -20),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      h('6000', 300, -20),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      h('Y1', -40, 0),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      h('Y2', -40, 200),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      h('Y3', -40, 400),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      v('6000', -20, 100),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      v('6000', -20, 300),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    ]\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('寃⑹옄???꾩쓽 遺?몃뒗 ?쇔춴????諛⑺뼢??媛뽰? ?딅뒗??, () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const parsed = parseFramingPlan(page([...gridItems(), h('C1', 200, 200)]))\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(parsed.blocks).toHaveLength(1)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(parsed.blocks[0]?.placements).toEqual([\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      { mark: 'C1', role: '?쇔춴??, ix: 1, iy: 1 },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    ])\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('X 以묒젏쨌Y 寃⑹옄?먯씠硫?渦?axis=X ???쒖옉 寃⑹옄?먯쓣 ?ｋ뒗??, () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const parsed = parseFramingPlan(page([...gridItems(), h('G1', 300, 200)]))\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(parsed.blocks[0]?.placements).toEqual([\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      { mark: 'G1', role: '渦?, ix: 1, iy: 1, axis: 'X' },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    ])\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('X 寃⑹옄?먃톉 以묒젏?대㈃ 渦?axis=Y', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const parsed = parseFramingPlan(page([...gridItems(), h('G2', 200, 100)]))\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(parsed.blocks[0]?.placements).toEqual([\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      { mark: 'G2', role: '渦?, ix: 1, iy: 0, axis: 'Y' },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    ])\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('?묒そ 以묒젏?대㈃ ?쇻궎 ???먯젏 履?寃⑹옄?먯쓣 ?ｋ뒗??, () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const parsed = parseFramingPlan(page([...gridItems(), h('S1', 300, 300)]))\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(parsed.blocks[0]?.placements).toEqual([\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      { mark: 'S1', role: '?쇻궎', ix: 1, iy: 1 },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    ])\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('寃⑹옄?먯뿉?쒕룄 以묒젏?먯꽌??癒?遺?몃뒗 吏?대궡吏 ?딄퀬 ?ら뀓營?줈 ?④릿??, () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    // ?덉슜? **以묒븰媛?* ?ㅽ뙩??1/4?대?濡? ?깃컙寃?寃⑹옄?먯꽌???대뒓 ?먯씠??諛섎뱶??    // ?대뵖媛??遺숇뒗??理쒕? 嫄곕━媛 ?뺥솗???덉슜怨?媛숇떎). 紐?遺숇뒗 ?먮━???좊궃??    // 湲??ㅽ뙩 ?덉뿉???앷릿?????ㅻЪ yokohama??1200mm ?좎? 8700mm ?ㅽ뙩泥섎읆\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const parsed = parseFramingPlan(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      page([\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        h('X1', 0, -40),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        h('X2', 200, -40),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        h('X3', 400, -40),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        h('X4', 1200, -40),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        h('6000', 100, -20),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        h('6000', 300, -20),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        h('24000', 800, -20),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        h('Y1', -40, 0),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        h('Y2', -40, 200),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        v('6000', -20, 100),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        // 寃⑹옄??400 ?먯꽌??以묒젏 800 ?먯꽌??200pt ??以묒븰媛??ㅽ뙩 200 ??1/4 ???섎뒗??        h('B1', 600, 0),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      ]),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    )\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(parsed.blocks[0]?.placements).toEqual([])\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(parsed.blocks[0]?.unplacedMarks).toEqual(['B1'])\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('釉붾줉 諛뽰쓽 遺?몃뒗 ?꾩삁 蹂댁? ?딅뒗????媛숈? ?섏씠吏????씊?ゃ궧?덇? ?욎씠吏 ?딅뒗??, () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const parsed = parseFramingPlan(page([...gridItems(), h('C9', 900, 900)]))\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(parsed.blocks[0]?.placements).